B.Q8=new A.cg(B.b4H,["Money is an integer in the currency\u2019s minor unit: paise for INR, cents for USD. 45000 in INR is \u20b9450.00. Columns: amount, opening_balance, *_minor.","INR or USD. An amount is in its row\u2019s currency, except counter_amount_minor (in counter_currency) and goal_links.amount_minor (in the linked account\u2019s or holding\u2019s).","1 USD in INR \xd7 10000 (in app_settings). 850000 is \u20b985.0000.","Quantity \xd7 10^8. 150000000 is 1.5 units. On the sale of a holding that has no units (an FD), the share of it sold: 100000000 is all of it.","Price per unit in the currency\u2019s major unit \xd7 10^4. 1234500 is 123.45.","Yearly rate in basis points. 710 is 7.10%. So is deposits.rate_bp, each FD\u2019s or RD\u2019s own rate (per annum); matures_on its first maturity; tenure_months and tenure_days its tenure, which a renewal repeats; compounding_months and payout_months how often its interest compounds and is paid out (0: simple interest; 0: added to it); on_maturity renew_all, renew_principal or close; deposit_rates the rates it was renewed at, from from_date on.","ISO-8601 text. occurred_at is the local time it happened, and tz_offset_minutes that place\u2019s offset from UTC; created_at and updated_at are UTC.","expense, income, transfer, buy or sell. A transfer moves amount from account_id to counter_account_id. An income row with a holding_id is a dividend. A buy, sell or dividend with a deposit_id belongs to that FD or RD in deposits; its time of day means nothing.","brokerage_minor, gst_minor and other_charges_minor are what the platform and the government took on a buy, a sell or a transfer, in the row\u2019s currency; empty is none. amount is the cash that moved: a buy\u2019s principal is amount less them, a sale\u2019s gross is amount plus them, and a transfer\u2019s destination gets counter_amount_minor when set, else amount less them.","is_archived, is_built_in and the like are 1 (yes) or 0 (no)."],t.li)
